<p>Hi {!Contact.Name},</p>

<p> We apologise that your recent experience with us was not to the standard we&rsquo;ve long held ourselves to. In
	acknowledgement of this we've credited {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c} Qantas Points to your Qantas Frequent Flyer
	account.</p>
<p> If you have any questions regarding your Qantas Points, please contact the Qantas Frequent Flyer team on 13 13 13.
</p>
<p> We appreciate your continued support.</p>

<p> Thank you,</p>
<p>The Qantas Frequent Flyer Team</p>


